WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 10=

01:43.820 --> 01:52.020
(Day Three After the Comeback)

01:52.780 --> 01:53.420
Ms. Lin,

01:56.860 --> 01:57.780
after last night,

01:57.780 --> 01:59.140
our numbers have finally picked up.

01:59.400 --> 02:00.540
Dingqi Platform pushed it.

02:00.780 --> 02:02.260
Drunk Old Friend has gripping twists,

02:02.260 --> 02:03.290
and people just can't stop reading.

02:03.300 --> 02:05.220
New subscriptions have
already passed thirty thousand.

02:05.220 --> 02:05.540
Ms. Lin.

02:05.620 --> 02:07.760
Also, the comments
under Drunk Old Friend have exploded.

02:07.900 --> 02:09.940
And WeChat has pushed our novel, too.

02:10.044 --> 02:10.980
What does this mean?

02:11.300 --> 02:12.980
This is what you call
small steps building

02:13.180 --> 02:14.260
into a long journey.

02:15.220 --> 02:16.100
How are things now?

02:16.500 --> 02:18.100
We're still in first place.

02:18.200 --> 02:19.533
Shattered Six States is second.

02:19.740 --> 02:21.340
(Drunk Old Friend real-time popularity)

02:21.340 --> 02:22.460
(Shattered Six States
real-time popularity)

02:22.580 --> 02:24.020
We're pulling ahead.

02:24.780 --> 02:26.530
We can release the next story preview

02:26.530 --> 02:27.340
that Gu Yan prepared.

02:27.488 --> 02:28.540
Let's push another wave.

02:28.622 --> 02:30.088
- Got it, Ms. Lin.
- Got it, Ms. Lin.

02:30.100 --> 02:30.580
Naobaijin,

02:30.888 --> 02:31.700
hurry it up.

02:31.980 --> 02:36.260
(Chapter 183, Story Preview. Please
bookmark and vote for Drunk Old Friend.)

02:40.100 --> 02:41.860
Lin Zhanqiao really
knows how to play this.

02:42.311 --> 02:43.288
You all saw that, right?

02:43.340 --> 02:44.020
Yeah, we saw it.

02:45.740 --> 02:46.740
Lin Zhanqiao doesn't

02:46.800 --> 02:49.140
have much money, but she
is still pouring it into marketing.

02:49.140 --> 02:51.100
She's all in with Gu Yan,

02:51.100 --> 02:52.820
win or lose.

02:53.860 --> 02:55.300
That's not her usual style.

02:55.540 --> 02:57.444
If you said Zhao Lanxin,
I'd believe it more.

02:58.460 --> 02:59.060
Jealous?

02:59.266 --> 03:01.288
She never went this hard for you,
did she?

03:01.660 --> 03:02.580
Don't be ridiculous.

03:03.140 --> 03:04.980
I never gave her that kind of chance.

03:04.980 --> 03:05.580
As a man,

03:05.580 --> 03:07.980
why would you want someone else
to spend money fighting for you?

03:08.060 --> 03:09.180
Go find Lin Zhanqiao?

03:09.460 --> 03:10.577
Depends on my mood.

03:29.740 --> 03:30.900
So what do we need to see

03:30.900 --> 03:32.620
before we can call it settled?

03:33.940 --> 03:35.580
I'd say it's already clear.

03:36.380 --> 03:37.460
So,

03:38.020 --> 03:39.420
we won?

03:41.022 --> 03:42.266
A comeback from behind.

03:43.420 --> 03:44.300
Drunk Old Friend

03:44.466 --> 03:45.533
has taken the top spot.

03:52.700 --> 03:53.380
Congratulations.

03:54.420 --> 03:54.900
Thanks.

04:00.620 --> 04:04.500
- Gu Yan!
- Gu Yan!

04:13.420 --> 04:16.340
(Drunk Old Friend takes the top spot!)

04:22.222 --> 04:23.866
So, how is it? Is Wang Hai first?

04:24.100 --> 04:24.540
First.

04:24.620 --> 04:25.420
The He is second.

04:26.980 --> 04:28.340
Is he staying in first?

04:29.060 --> 04:29.700
No idea.

04:29.700 --> 04:31.540
The internet says Gu Yan is number one.

04:33.900 --> 04:35.180
This guy's got it.

04:36.980 --> 04:37.940
Hey, what's wrong?

04:38.220 --> 04:39.177
You're not happy?

04:40.060 --> 04:40.740
I am.

04:41.340 --> 04:42.260
I'm happy for Gu Yan.

04:43.340 --> 04:44.900
Boss, terminal 16 crashed.

04:59.740 --> 05:00.500
You're not happy?

05:01.933 --> 05:03.244
It just doesn't feel fair.

05:06.300 --> 05:07.340
Things aren't always fair,

05:07.822 --> 05:09.600
and they don't always go your way.

05:11.260 --> 05:11.780
Cheer up.

05:13.900 --> 05:14.260
Alright.

05:14.580 --> 05:16.900
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

05:37.980 --> 05:39.620
This rear-view mirror is pretty flashy.

05:40.540 --> 05:41.600
The car is really yours?

05:42.620 --> 05:43.340
Of course.

05:43.500 --> 05:44.733
Want to see the registration?

05:44.780 --> 05:46.666
I've already signed up for ride-sharing.

05:46.688 --> 05:48.333
It should be approved tonight.

05:50.020 --> 05:51.180
Driving a car like this

05:51.260 --> 05:52.420
and doing rideshare,

05:52.822 --> 05:54.044
what are you after?

05:54.244 --> 05:55.540
Trying out a different lifestyle,

05:55.660 --> 05:56.700
or picking up girls?

05:56.900 --> 05:58.022
What do you think?

05:59.044 --> 06:00.822
How many people have
you added on WeChat?

06:00.860 --> 06:02.180
You're my first passenger.

06:02.180 --> 06:03.380
Others didn't dare get in.

06:04.820 --> 06:05.980
Do I look like a bad guy?

06:06.100 --> 06:06.860
You

06:07.111 --> 06:08.711
must be in your forties, right?

06:09.660 --> 06:10.540
Think I'm old?

06:17.020 --> 06:21.340
(Cai Zhangzhu: Are you free tonight?
I have a few questions to ask.)

06:26.580 --> 06:27.533
Add me on WeChat.

06:27.620 --> 06:29.177
I'll give you a discount next time.

06:29.260 --> 06:29.620
Thanks.

06:36.220 --> 06:36.620
Bye.

06:36.740 --> 06:37.020
Bye.

06:43.940 --> 06:47.780
(Cai Zhangzhu: Are you free tonight?
I have a few questions to ask.)

06:53.900 --> 06:56.620
(Legend: I'll message you
when I'm done tonight.)

07:01.220 --> 07:01.660
Ms. Lin,

07:02.260 --> 07:02.940
are you leaving?

07:03.900 --> 07:05.340
One thing is finally off my mind.

07:05.660 --> 07:07.111
I'm going back to get some rest.

07:07.420 --> 07:08.020
How about

07:08.444 --> 07:10.044
having dinner before you go?

07:11.060 --> 07:11.900
Not tonight.

07:12.000 --> 07:14.010
We'll have plenty of
chances to eat together.

07:14.020 --> 07:14.810
No need to rush today.

07:14.810 --> 07:16.620
But shouldn't we celebrate today?

07:17.420 --> 07:18.820
This is just the first step.

07:19.420 --> 07:20.180
When we finish it,

07:20.260 --> 07:21.444
we'll celebrate properly.

07:21.688 --> 07:23.133
You should head back and rest, too.

07:23.140 --> 07:24.488
We will keep going tomorrow.

07:24.540 --> 07:24.940
Bye.

07:26.260 --> 07:26.700
Bye.

07:28.060 --> 07:28.740
Bye, Ms. Lin.

07:28.900 --> 07:29.420
Ms. Lin.

07:31.180 --> 07:31.780
Bye, Ms. Lin.

09:16.620 --> 09:17.740
I got off work early today.

09:17.860 --> 09:19.620
He asked if I wanted to meet for dinner.

09:23.860 --> 09:25.060
Of course not.

09:25.155 --> 09:26.755
You can't just go whenever he calls.

09:26.866 --> 09:28.688
Set a time and have him come to you.

09:31.200 --> 09:33.177
Are you coming back for dinner tonight?

09:35.500 --> 09:36.260
No.

09:36.500 --> 09:37.380
I have plans.

09:44.940 --> 09:50.060
(Lin Zhanqiao: Not today. Another time.)

09:59.822 --> 10:00.688
I'm back.

10:03.580 --> 10:04.980
Finally. Come on, hurry.

10:05.180 --> 10:05.460
Quick.

10:06.340 --> 10:07.260
Sit down and eat.

10:08.288 --> 10:09.355
To celebrate your victory,

10:09.377 --> 10:10.866
San Mei has been cooking all afternoon.

10:11.600 --> 10:13.180
Didn't expect you to come back so early.

10:13.180 --> 10:14.020
Thought you'd be out with Ms. Lin,

10:14.020 --> 10:15.422
having a celebration dinner first.

10:15.780 --> 10:17.460
No, there wasn't any dinner tonight.

10:17.860 --> 10:19.780
We just celebrated a bit this afternoon.

10:19.780 --> 10:21.020
What? No celebration dinner?

10:21.140 --> 10:22.133
Is everyone that busy?

10:22.380 --> 10:23.220
I guess so.

10:23.900 --> 10:25.210
It's my first time,

10:25.210 --> 10:27.420
but for Ms. Lin,
she's probably had plenty.

10:28.580 --> 10:30.020
I was all ready today,

10:30.020 --> 10:31.300
thinking Ms. Lin would come too.

10:31.620 --> 10:32.780
See? She planned it well.

10:32.860 --> 10:34.260
Too bad Ms. Lin didn't come.

10:35.140 --> 10:36.700
Forget it. We'll celebrate ourselves.

10:36.777 --> 10:37.800
- Come on.
- Let's go.

10:43.660 --> 10:45.130
I just threw this together.

10:45.130 --> 10:46.733
Nothing compared to those big banquets.

10:47.260 --> 10:48.380
What do big banquets matter?

10:48.860 --> 10:49.540
Once I make money,

10:49.622 --> 10:51.600
I'll take you all to the best,
most expensive places.

10:51.620 --> 10:52.780
Like anyone cares.

10:53.140 --> 10:54.140
Honestly, food outside

10:54.140 --> 10:55.500
isn't as good as San Mei's cooking.

10:55.711 --> 10:57.260
Besides, you're getting too famous.

10:57.260 --> 10:59.088
That might not be
a good thing for the internet cafe.

10:59.500 --> 11:00.260
But you won.

11:00.660 --> 11:01.700
We're just happy for you.

11:02.260 --> 11:02.660
Right?

11:02.860 --> 11:03.180
Yeah.

11:04.380 --> 11:05.220
Come on, cheers.

11:06.660 --> 11:07.140
Thank you.

11:07.620 --> 11:09.300
No need to thank us.

11:58.780 --> 12:00.060
Another drink.

12:02.300 --> 12:03.060
Here, take it.

12:04.700 --> 12:06.140
Congratulations, Editor Lin.

12:06.140 --> 12:07.180
Why didn't you call

12:07.180 --> 12:08.100
and show off a bit?

12:10.140 --> 12:10.820
Where are you?

12:11.140 --> 12:11.740
Got time?

12:12.088 --> 12:13.100
Come chat for a bit.

12:13.100 --> 12:14.060
Sure, come over.

12:14.060 --> 12:14.980
It's lively here.

12:15.140 --> 12:16.644
There are drinks and pretty company.

12:17.940 --> 12:20.620
Cheers.

12:21.980 --> 12:23.422
You guys go ahead. I'll make a call.

12:23.740 --> 12:24.210
Alright.

12:24.210 --> 12:25.220
Come by later, Mr. He.

12:25.220 --> 12:26.300
See you later, Mr. He.

12:26.300 --> 12:27.466
What I wanted to tell you is,

12:28.220 --> 12:29.533
regarding what happened today,

12:29.900 --> 12:32.140
Mr. Fan played a huge part.

12:32.940 --> 12:33.980
I don't know why

12:33.980 --> 12:35.580
he helped Gu Yan and me so much.

12:36.866 --> 12:38.860
But if it's because of your
relationship with Dai Shan

12:38.860 --> 12:40.244
that he misunderstood something,

12:40.260 --> 12:42.100
or if he has something against you,

12:43.060 --> 12:44.100
shouldn't you find a chance

12:44.100 --> 12:45.200
to clear things up with him?

12:45.244 --> 12:47.111
Tell him you two are
just putting on an act.

12:47.580 --> 12:48.140
Otherwise,

12:48.500 --> 12:49.220
I'm worried

12:49.220 --> 12:50.933
that if he keeps
targeting you like this,

12:50.977 --> 12:52.180
it'll be thankless for you

12:52.266 --> 12:53.533
to keep writing later.

12:58.020 --> 12:59.540
I'm only reminding you out of goodwill.

13:00.020 --> 13:00.740
Nothing else.

13:03.780 --> 13:04.700
Come on, Lin Zhanqiao.

13:04.822 --> 13:05.933
You don't seriously think

13:05.940 --> 13:07.577
I care about being
first or second, do you?

13:08.260 --> 13:09.288
If anything, it's you.

13:09.780 --> 13:12.300
You keep pushing me over and over
to break up with Dai Shan.

13:12.820 --> 13:15.180
So is Mr. Fan jealous, or are you?

13:17.100 --> 13:19.100
Is something wrong with you?

13:19.580 --> 13:20.860
Do you have to

13:20.940 --> 13:22.688
get all narcissistic
every chance you get?

13:23.180 --> 13:24.460
So the people out there

13:24.820 --> 13:25.820
have to put up with you

13:25.820 --> 13:27.300
just because you're He Han?

13:27.300 --> 13:28.644
Well, if it's not, just say so.

13:28.650 --> 13:31.222
Why are you reacting so strongly?
What else am I supposed to think?

13:47.500 --> 13:49.580
Come on, let's liven things up.

13:50.600 --> 13:52.260
Tonight, we have to enjoy ourselves.

13:52.340 --> 13:53.540
It's on me!

13:53.740 --> 13:55.020
Thank you, Mr. He.

13:55.100 --> 13:56.340
Thank you.

13:56.622 --> 13:58.777
- Thank you, Mr. He Han.
- Come on, drink up.

14:18.555 --> 14:19.622
You just got back,

14:19.900 --> 14:21.111
or you're going out again?

14:21.380 --> 14:22.430
You haven't even changed.

14:22.620 --> 14:23.460
I'm going out.

14:24.500 --> 14:25.711
Be careful at night, then.

14:26.540 --> 14:28.140
He didn't say what time.

14:28.140 --> 14:29.860
He just said he'd find me
when he's done.

14:30.460 --> 14:30.860
A friend?

14:31.660 --> 14:32.220
Boyfriend?

14:34.460 --> 14:34.940
Friend.

14:39.660 --> 14:40.500
I'm back.

14:42.340 --> 14:42.940
Careful.

14:45.580 --> 14:46.060
Who are you?

14:46.700 --> 14:47.620
I'm Zhangzhu.

14:48.980 --> 14:49.860
So you're Zhangzhu?

14:50.620 --> 14:51.180
It's okay.

14:55.100 --> 14:55.740
I'm Zhou Mei.

14:56.540 --> 14:57.420
Hi, Zhou Mei.

14:58.820 --> 15:00.020
You're so pretty.

15:00.555 --> 15:01.777
Get me a glass of water.

15:02.220 --> 15:02.540
Okay.

15:05.380 --> 15:06.500
Who did you have dinner with?

15:07.180 --> 15:08.060
I ate alone.

15:16.220 --> 15:17.500
You drank this much alone?

15:20.711 --> 15:22.466
Because I was waiting for someone.

15:23.422 --> 15:24.888
That's why I drank so much.

15:36.260 --> 15:37.700
Hello, ma'am. Here's your menu.

15:38.820 --> 15:39.220
Thank you.

15:41.980 --> 15:43.380
Is this the menu Lawyer Bei ordered?

15:43.660 --> 15:45.220
Yes. It was ordered a month ago.

15:46.022 --> 15:47.511
Bring me a glass of wine first.

15:47.733 --> 15:48.733
Okay.

15:51.260 --> 15:52.180
A month ago,

15:52.340 --> 15:53.940
we agreed to have dinner together today.

15:55.460 --> 15:57.180
So you waited for him all night,

15:57.288 --> 15:58.533
and he didn't come?

16:01.177 --> 16:02.577
Did he do it on purpose?

16:03.860 --> 16:05.300
I know he wouldn't forget.

16:08.222 --> 16:10.140
He's not the kind of person
who forgets dates.

16:15.100 --> 16:16.100
He chose not to come.

16:17.500 --> 16:18.380
To punish me.

16:20.900 --> 16:22.220
To tell me I was too reckless

16:23.266 --> 16:25.644
and shouldn't have
gone downstairs to his place.

16:39.340 --> 16:42.660
♪First Time in love♪

16:44.700 --> 16:45.540
Hello, ma'am.

16:45.577 --> 16:47.180
May I ask if Mr. Bei is still coming?

16:47.340 --> 16:49.133
Would you like us to
serve the dishes first?

16:50.300 --> 16:50.780
No.

16:51.422 --> 16:53.466
He had something
come up and couldn't make it.

16:54.177 --> 16:55.088
Just bring the bill.

16:55.620 --> 16:56.900
Mr. Bei has already paid.

16:56.900 --> 16:58.580
♪Yet no one will ever know♪

16:58.580 --> 16:59.340
He's already paid?

16:59.740 --> 17:00.300
When?

17:01.020 --> 17:01.700
His assistant,

17:01.700 --> 17:03.580
Mr. Zhang, called to settle it for him.

17:07.940 --> 17:08.260
Alright.

17:08.780 --> 17:09.180
Thank you.

17:12.300 --> 17:15.860
♪And here you are♪

17:18.060 --> 17:21.140
♪Calling my name in the air♪

17:23.100 --> 17:25.060
If you still deal
with someone like that,

17:26.660 --> 17:28.260
you're doing yourself a disservice.

17:28.780 --> 17:31.500
♪I see you at the end♪

17:31.500 --> 17:32.540
But who isn't like that?

17:34.620 --> 17:36.740
The one who leaves
you shattered every time

17:37.800 --> 17:39.380
is the one you still can't help loving

17:40.533 --> 17:42.577
once you pull yourself back together.

17:56.288 --> 17:57.911
Do you have a boyfriend?

18:00.100 --> 18:00.540
No.

18:05.377 --> 18:07.400
You don't happen
to like He Han too, right?

18:10.260 --> 18:11.100
Let me tell you,

18:11.422 --> 18:12.900
He Han belongs to Lin Zhanqiao.

18:13.420 --> 18:14.460
We've broken up for good.

18:16.900 --> 18:18.260
I've been meaning to ask,

18:18.260 --> 18:20.140
why did you break up?

18:21.540 --> 18:22.780
Because Lin Zhanqiao believes

18:22.866 --> 18:24.420
that in a relationship, in marriage,

18:24.420 --> 18:25.911
everything should be shared.

18:26.420 --> 18:26.860
Money,

18:27.540 --> 18:28.700
house, car,

18:29.820 --> 18:31.260
time, thoughts, and everything.

18:32.060 --> 18:32.940
But He Han believes

18:33.000 --> 18:34.330
that in a relationship, in marriage,

18:34.340 --> 18:35.622
it simply means I love you.

18:36.340 --> 18:37.300
But you

18:37.500 --> 18:39.620
seem like an independent woman, Ms. Lin.

18:41.940 --> 18:43.900
That has nothing
to do with independence.

18:47.540 --> 18:48.060
Independence

18:50.180 --> 18:51.700
is something everyone has

18:52.580 --> 18:53.580
once they enter society.

18:57.540 --> 18:58.540
After eighteen,

18:59.180 --> 19:00.340
men and women,

19:00.955 --> 19:02.177
before or after marriage,

19:02.355 --> 19:03.444
it's the same, right?

19:06.340 --> 19:06.820
But then,

19:07.288 --> 19:08.700
why do we call love and marriage

19:08.700 --> 19:10.300
an intimate relationship?

19:15.220 --> 19:16.380
If two independent people

19:18.420 --> 19:20.300
want to enter into intimacy,

19:21.060 --> 19:22.660
they first have to be close.

19:23.980 --> 19:25.300
Because this kind of relationship

19:25.300 --> 19:27.380
is unlike any other.

19:28.244 --> 19:30.133
Even different from the relationship

19:30.420 --> 19:31.955
you have with your parents as an adult.

19:33.900 --> 19:36.060
So what Mr. He Han means is

19:38.222 --> 19:39.511
just saying "I love you,"

19:40.180 --> 19:41.860
and everything else is optional?

19:44.740 --> 19:45.940
My question is,

19:47.460 --> 19:48.820
what defines intimacy?

19:51.500 --> 19:53.100
Some people enter a relationship

19:53.355 --> 19:54.644
but are not truly close at all.

20:04.355 --> 20:05.311
I just opened it.

20:05.420 --> 20:06.355
Hurry and try it.

20:07.977 --> 20:09.977
I was worried you
might be in a bad mood,

20:10.000 --> 20:12.311
so I brought a good bottle for you.

20:19.380 --> 20:21.180
Can you tell me honestly?

20:21.660 --> 20:23.400
You're helping Lin Zhanqiao this much,

20:24.060 --> 20:25.200
so what are you after?

20:29.180 --> 20:30.940
I want her to owe me a favor.

20:31.500 --> 20:32.700
So if I need something later,

20:33.140 --> 20:34.220
she can pay me back.

20:36.100 --> 20:36.933
I didn't lie.

20:38.777 --> 20:39.622
You haven't

20:40.288 --> 20:42.355
figured out
how she'll repay you yet

20:43.022 --> 20:44.511
and you're helping her first?

20:44.620 --> 20:47.340
This doesn't quite add up, right?

21:04.100 --> 21:06.244
(Campus Spotlight, Gathering of Talents,
No. 54 Middle School,)

21:06.244 --> 21:08.100
(Class of 2013,
Outstanding Alumni, Wang Hai)

21:08.100 --> 21:09.820
(Wang Hai, writing as Gu Yan)

21:14.780 --> 21:15.380
What's wrong?

21:20.400 --> 21:22.460
Your writing career
is getting more successful.

21:24.260 --> 21:25.140
I'm happy for you.

21:27.700 --> 21:28.980
I hope you keep getting better.

21:30.022 --> 21:32.111
But at the same time,
I'm afraid you'll get better.

21:35.540 --> 21:36.500
Because before,

21:36.780 --> 21:37.940
we were struggling together.

21:39.780 --> 21:41.220
Now we can't succeed together.

21:42.822 --> 21:44.000
If you succeed,

21:44.820 --> 21:45.460
we won't.

21:45.980 --> 21:47.060
No.

21:47.380 --> 21:48.340
We'll all be fine.

21:52.260 --> 21:53.300
Then tell me,

21:53.933 --> 21:56.111
how are we supposed to be fine together?

21:57.100 --> 21:58.140
If I make it,

21:58.780 --> 22:00.460
I'll have money and opportunities

22:00.622 --> 22:02.355
to bring you all along with me.

22:03.580 --> 22:04.580
Back then,

22:05.020 --> 22:06.820
we shared the hard times.

22:07.660 --> 22:08.140
Now,

22:08.444 --> 22:09.977
we'll share the good times.

22:11.244 --> 22:13.111
I'm not cut out for
enjoying that kind of life.

22:14.700 --> 22:17.100
I just want to stay here like this.

22:23.020 --> 22:23.780
What if

22:24.622 --> 22:26.340
the one sharing the good times with you

22:27.888 --> 22:29.333
ends up being someone else?

22:29.860 --> 22:31.180
What are you talking about?

22:34.100 --> 22:35.020
Like Lin Zhanqiao.

22:40.780 --> 22:42.340
I know you don't like her.

22:43.580 --> 22:44.900
She looks down on Er Jiu and me.

22:46.088 --> 22:47.933
She looks down on this internet cafe.

22:48.500 --> 22:50.020
She thinks we'll hold you back.

22:51.511 --> 22:53.500
Sooner or later,
she'll take you away from us.

22:53.860 --> 22:55.420
She never said that.

22:55.620 --> 22:57.100
And I've never thought that either.

23:01.140 --> 23:02.300
Then, prove it to me.

23:05.180 --> 23:07.260
Isn't my being here right now proof?

23:07.688 --> 23:09.355
What more do you want me to do?

23:09.780 --> 23:11.740
What, you want me to stop writing

23:11.844 --> 23:13.444
and come back to be a manager here?

23:15.860 --> 23:16.460
If that

23:18.660 --> 23:19.300
were the case,

23:21.300 --> 23:22.020
would you do it?

23:28.140 --> 23:29.020
No.

23:31.340 --> 23:33.500
Whether it's writing online fiction
or managing a cafe,

23:35.100 --> 23:37.200
isn't it all for making money
and living better?

23:37.688 --> 23:39.866
What's wrong with
choosing whatever earns more?

23:46.660 --> 23:48.100
All you think about is yourself.

23:50.380 --> 23:51.940
You don't want to leave this place,

23:52.900 --> 23:53.980
so you expect everyone else

23:54.180 --> 23:55.500
to stay here with you

23:55.755 --> 23:57.222
and work at this cafe forever.

23:58.177 --> 24:00.333
Aren't you also just
thinking about yourself?

25:11.155 --> 25:12.977
Register at the counter
before logging in.

25:34.740 --> 25:35.140
Hello.

25:35.900 --> 25:36.620
4893.

25:39.740 --> 25:40.260
Let's go.

26:03.460 --> 26:03.980
Hey,

26:04.340 --> 26:05.500
do you know what kind of car

26:05.500 --> 26:06.977
I got a ride in after work today?

26:06.980 --> 26:08.100
I'll send you a picture.

26:10.780 --> 26:12.620
Sir, you can just pull over ahead.

26:12.820 --> 26:13.180
Alright.

26:15.260 --> 26:15.940
Sure thing.

26:17.100 --> 26:17.620
Thanks.

26:18.200 --> 26:19.330
Please give a good rating.

26:19.330 --> 26:19.900
Of course.

26:44.980 --> 26:46.980
(Legend: Meet at the corner cafe
on Fuxing Road.)

27:20.060 --> 27:20.980
Mr. He Han.

27:21.500 --> 27:22.420
Here. Sit.

27:24.511 --> 27:26.220
I'm not sure what you young people like,

27:26.220 --> 27:27.180
so I just ordered a bit.

27:27.300 --> 27:28.380
Thank you, Mr. He Han.

27:28.644 --> 27:30.700
I asked you out,
so I should be the one treating.

27:31.180 --> 27:31.900
Forget it.

27:32.044 --> 27:33.755
You can't even afford rent right now.

27:36.220 --> 27:36.980
Go on,

27:37.460 --> 27:38.580
what's so urgent?

27:40.300 --> 27:41.180
It's like this.

27:42.060 --> 27:43.260
At the company,

27:43.311 --> 27:45.466
I've started handling
the selection of new authors.

27:45.620 --> 27:47.380
But when it comes to the criteria,

27:47.860 --> 27:49.000
it always feels like

27:49.044 --> 27:51.100
something is off here or there.

27:54.000 --> 27:55.444
Have you met them in person?

27:56.020 --> 27:56.460
No.

27:57.177 --> 27:59.111
Don't you usually read
their submissions first?

27:59.260 --> 28:00.100
Meet them more.

28:00.777 --> 28:02.200
If their abilities are about the same,

28:02.220 --> 28:03.500
pick the better-looking one

28:03.500 --> 28:04.688
with a nicer temperament.

28:05.060 --> 28:06.740
What does being good-looking matter?

28:07.100 --> 28:08.260
You'll have to work with them.

28:08.340 --> 28:10.060
You'll be in contact
every day for years.

28:11.140 --> 28:12.250
If they look better,

28:12.250 --> 28:13.660
won't it put you in a better mood?

28:14.980 --> 28:16.180
That actually makes some sense.

28:19.620 --> 28:20.288
Anything else?

28:20.500 --> 28:20.980
That's it?

28:21.533 --> 28:23.066
You were in such a hurry to see me

28:23.088 --> 28:24.711
just to ask something like this?

28:27.733 --> 28:28.980
Is your boss treating you badly?

28:29.500 --> 28:30.220
No.

28:30.600 --> 28:32.050
Are you not used to living at her place?

28:32.060 --> 28:32.420
No.

28:32.740 --> 28:33.860
Then, what could it be?

28:39.140 --> 28:39.580
Fine.

28:39.700 --> 28:41.111
If you won't say it, I'm leaving.

28:41.700 --> 28:42.340
Mr. He Han,

28:45.580 --> 28:45.900
I'm here

28:46.580 --> 28:48.060
on behalf of your readers

28:48.540 --> 28:49.860
to check on you.

28:51.060 --> 28:53.700
We're worried you might stop updating
or stop writing altogether.

28:58.980 --> 29:00.488
You mean what happened this morning?

29:04.940 --> 29:05.660
Mr. He Han,

29:06.340 --> 29:08.260
this really isn't a big deal.

29:08.980 --> 29:09.980
In our hearts,

29:09.980 --> 29:11.180
you'll always be number one.

29:11.540 --> 29:13.500
Even if one day,
something happens again,

29:13.580 --> 29:14.340
or one day,

29:15.420 --> 29:16.300
you stop writing,

29:16.300 --> 29:18.222
and your name
is no longer on the charts,

29:19.220 --> 29:20.020
to us,

29:20.020 --> 29:21.540
you'll still be like a legend.

29:23.700 --> 29:24.220
Thank you.

29:25.700 --> 29:26.700
Although I think

29:26.700 --> 29:28.266
you could've just sent that on WeChat,

29:28.340 --> 29:29.340
thank you anyway.

29:29.488 --> 29:30.800
Thank you, all of you.

29:35.980 --> 29:36.300
I...

29:37.660 --> 29:40.260
I was just worried you'd
be in a bad mood today,

29:42.580 --> 29:43.220
feeling down.

29:53.500 --> 29:55.140
Do you really think that little of me?

29:57.500 --> 29:59.700
Any author who has made it this far

29:59.700 --> 30:01.180
is tough enough to take a beating.

30:02.060 --> 30:03.660
Do I seem that fragile to you?

30:06.340 --> 30:06.740
So,

30:07.220 --> 30:09.340
can we still expect regular updates?

30:09.660 --> 30:11.620
Are you worried about the novel or me?

30:14.580 --> 30:15.420
Both.

30:16.540 --> 30:17.300
Don't worry.

30:18.140 --> 30:20.740
I'll keep updating
like the sun rises every day.

30:22.900 --> 30:23.260
Alright.

30:23.900 --> 30:24.460
Eat.

30:24.540 --> 30:25.733
I'll take you back after.

30:26.300 --> 30:26.660
Okay.

30:35.020 --> 30:35.860
This is really good.

30:54.180 --> 30:54.888
Where's Zhangzhu?

30:55.060 --> 30:55.700
Still asleep?

31:04.644 --> 31:06.200
Have you decided what to wear?

31:07.100 --> 31:07.777
What is it?

31:08.866 --> 31:10.800
Don't you have
a date in a couple of days?

31:10.860 --> 31:11.860
Pick out something nice.

31:12.660 --> 31:13.660
I don't even want to go.

31:14.822 --> 31:16.420
Even though the match rate is already

31:16.420 --> 31:17.380
ninety percent,

31:17.980 --> 31:20.100
that remaining ten percent

31:20.460 --> 31:22.140
has a major issue.

31:22.740 --> 31:23.380
What issue?

31:24.155 --> 31:25.511
Sleeping in separate rooms?

31:27.900 --> 31:28.740
He has a child,

31:29.244 --> 31:30.777
but the child doesn't live with him.

31:32.260 --> 31:33.333
What does he look like?

31:34.580 --> 31:35.980
From the avatar, he looks okay.

31:36.380 --> 31:37.140
No photos?

31:37.955 --> 31:39.860
The platform doesn't
want us judging by looks,

31:39.860 --> 31:40.460
so basically,

31:40.700 --> 31:42.300
it matches you based on

31:42.300 --> 31:43.220
the height and weight

31:43.820 --> 31:44.740
you provide.

31:45.660 --> 31:47.100
Even the avatar is generated by AI

31:47.740 --> 31:49.620
based on your real-life photos.

31:50.060 --> 31:50.580
So the idea

31:50.780 --> 31:53.140
is matching lifestyle and mindset.

31:54.180 --> 31:55.180
Then, just go meet him.

31:55.533 --> 31:56.800
He might be decent, right?

31:57.140 --> 31:58.620
If he's not, message me,

31:58.666 --> 32:00.044
and I'll come rescue you.

32:00.533 --> 32:02.111
You haven't had plans at night lately?

32:02.260 --> 32:02.620
No.

32:03.266 --> 32:04.755
You haven't contacted Lawyer Bei?

32:04.980 --> 32:06.311
He hasn't contacted you either?

32:08.060 --> 32:08.380
No.

32:10.260 --> 32:11.100
Don't see him.

32:12.540 --> 32:13.980
If being together makes you unhappy,

32:14.620 --> 32:15.860
then now is the best time

32:16.333 --> 32:18.577
to cut things off completely.
Don't meet him again.

32:20.100 --> 32:20.700
I promise.

32:23.580 --> 32:24.660
Pick out a nice outfit.

32:24.822 --> 32:26.711
What if he turns out to be good-looking?

32:32.333 --> 32:33.533
Is it Lawyer Bei?

32:39.460 --> 32:39.980
He said

32:40.266 --> 32:42.288
let's have lunch on Saturday at noon.

32:43.060 --> 32:44.460
You just promised me

32:45.333 --> 32:46.333
you wouldn't go.

32:48.940 --> 32:49.340
I won't.

32:51.020 --> 32:52.860
He can't just act
as if nothing happened.

32:53.500 --> 32:55.380
Right now, he's trying to control you,

32:55.800 --> 32:57.311
trying to manipulate you.

32:57.380 --> 32:58.300
If you go,

32:58.660 --> 33:00.155
you'll fall right into his trap.

33:15.500 --> 33:17.100
(Have lunch together Saturday at noon?)

33:17.100 --> 33:18.900
(I have plans on Saturday.
Sorry, I won't be able to make it.)

33:30.100 --> 33:34.060
(Zhou Mei: Okay, see you Saturday.)

34:31.540 --> 34:32.020
Hello?

34:32.900 --> 34:33.380
Mr. He,

34:33.430 --> 34:35.577
the two boxes of beer
have been delivered to your door.

34:36.700 --> 34:38.060
What beer? I didn't order anything.

35:11.620 --> 35:12.466
This is pretty good.

35:12.860 --> 35:13.911
Meals and lodging included.

35:13.940 --> 35:14.620
For how long?

35:15.380 --> 35:15.980
For life.

35:18.020 --> 35:18.660
Single room?

35:18.980 --> 35:19.460
Double.

35:21.660 --> 35:22.780
Three hundred a day?

35:23.940 --> 35:25.700
There's a mahjong room
and nursing staff.

35:25.900 --> 35:26.820
Then 350.

35:27.620 --> 35:28.777
That's 10,000 a month,

35:28.820 --> 35:29.780
120,000 a year.

35:29.955 --> 35:31.460
Even if you live another ten years,

35:31.620 --> 35:33.133
that's only about 1.2 million.

35:35.311 --> 35:36.644
I don't live that long.

35:36.820 --> 35:38.444
Then, it won't even reach that.

35:39.060 --> 35:40.540
How much is your place worth anyway?

35:40.860 --> 35:41.844
It's old and run down,

35:41.850 --> 35:43.650
but it should still sell
for two or three million.

35:43.660 --> 35:45.511
The housing market
isn't great right now.

35:45.822 --> 35:47.720
The retirement home
is offering 300,000 in cash.

35:47.740 --> 35:48.540
300,000?

35:49.000 --> 35:50.888
You're getting ripped off,
you know that?

35:51.060 --> 35:51.860
It's my place.

35:52.020 --> 35:53.644
I can do whatever I want with it.

35:55.060 --> 35:55.860
Fine, suit yourself.

35:56.644 --> 35:57.850
Living that far away works too.

35:57.860 --> 35:59.400
No one's going to visit you anyway.

36:01.900 --> 36:03.022
At the retirement home,

36:03.220 --> 36:04.380
I filled out my profile.

36:04.980 --> 36:05.420
No family.

36:05.940 --> 36:06.580
No children.

36:07.140 --> 36:07.740
That's great.

36:09.511 --> 36:11.244
So why are you looking for me?

36:23.700 --> 36:24.980
I sorted these out while moving.

36:25.066 --> 36:26.600
See if there's anything you still want.

36:26.610 --> 36:27.711
If not, I'll throw them away.

36:31.977 --> 36:33.533
I didn't even want to bring them.

36:33.600 --> 36:35.733
What's the point of
keeping them after someone dies?

36:35.822 --> 36:37.133
Out of sight, out of mind.

36:41.088 --> 36:42.380
You'll be dead soon enough, too.

36:42.640 --> 36:44.288
When you die, I'll burn all your things

36:44.333 --> 36:45.260
for you right away.

36:45.777 --> 36:47.140
If you leave even a scrap behind,

36:47.220 --> 36:48.422
you're no better than an animal.

36:49.220 --> 36:50.900
Don't even put my photo on my grave.

36:51.422 --> 36:52.940
When I die, just let me have some peace.

36:53.100 --> 36:54.860
Don't worry.
No one will visit you anyway.

36:54.980 --> 36:56.940
You don't even need a grave,
let alone a photo.

36:56.940 --> 36:58.755
When I die,
I won't have anyone notify you.

36:58.760 --> 37:00.500
You might as well
consider me dead already.

37:00.500 --> 37:02.500
If you hadn't come today,
I already would have.

37:56.300 --> 37:56.620
Come.

37:58.300 --> 37:59.660
It's always lively here.

38:02.620 --> 38:03.620
Miss, come.

38:04.060 --> 38:04.420
Let's go.

38:04.820 --> 38:06.580
This is the place I mentioned.

38:11.220 --> 38:12.060
It's this one.

38:15.380 --> 38:15.980
Miss,

38:17.020 --> 38:18.140
are you really not afraid?

38:19.300 --> 38:20.980
If the price is low enough, I'm not.

38:21.460 --> 38:21.980
Alright.

38:22.100 --> 38:23.200
I'll take you upstairs.

38:26.020 --> 38:27.660
This house is over 100 years old.

38:27.740 --> 38:29.900
Thirty square meters of living space.

38:30.220 --> 38:31.300
That's already pretty good.

38:31.540 --> 38:33.700
Men and women
who've come to see it before

38:33.980 --> 38:35.740
all backed out because they were scared.

38:36.340 --> 38:37.700
But if you think about it,

38:38.380 --> 38:39.620
old houses like this

38:39.620 --> 38:41.180
are bound to have things.

38:41.700 --> 38:43.060
I'm a straightforward person.

38:43.380 --> 38:44.540
When people come to view it,

38:44.740 --> 38:46.220
I tell them honestly.

38:46.540 --> 38:47.140
Otherwise,

38:47.500 --> 38:48.980
they will blame me later.

38:49.140 --> 38:49.740
Right?

38:50.140 --> 38:50.460
Come.

38:53.220 --> 38:53.900
This is the room.

39:31.380 --> 39:32.540
Why are you still here?

39:35.066 --> 39:37.644
I can't move into the retirement
home until the day after tomorrow.

39:38.060 --> 39:39.580
Why not stay home a couple more days?

39:40.340 --> 39:41.540
I miscalculated the dates.

39:42.044 --> 39:44.380
After signing the contract,
it was supposed to be 30 days,

39:44.666 --> 39:46.200
or a few days, before moving in.

39:46.860 --> 39:48.220
So I contacted the retirement home.

39:48.420 --> 39:49.420
Move in after 30 days.

39:49.620 --> 39:51.060
Who knew I got the days wrong?

39:52.511 --> 39:54.066
Where are you planning to stay?

39:54.420 --> 39:54.980
Here.

39:55.066 --> 39:56.444
Otherwise, why would I come to you?

39:56.460 --> 39:58.400
Didn't you say you
came to give me the photos?

39:58.700 --> 40:00.860
Those old photos
aren't worth a special trip.

40:04.020 --> 40:04.340
Fine.

40:14.660 --> 40:15.060
Get up.

40:18.000 --> 40:18.822
What are you doing?

40:19.060 --> 40:19.580
Come on.

40:19.580 --> 40:21.180
Take your things and come with me.

40:23.800 --> 40:24.866
You're kicking me out?

40:25.260 --> 40:25.820
Listen,

40:25.940 --> 40:26.580
I'm your father.

40:26.711 --> 40:28.244
If you kick me out, I'll call the police

40:28.250 --> 40:29.880
to report
that you're abusing the elderly.

40:30.000 --> 40:30.860
Come downstairs with me.

40:30.860 --> 40:32.866
I'll get you a room
at the front desk, okay?

40:39.140 --> 40:41.140
(Name: He Wei)

40:44.380 --> 40:45.660
You really got 300,000 in cash?

40:46.177 --> 40:47.200
Why would I lie to you?

40:47.700 --> 40:48.700
Did you bring the money?

40:49.220 --> 40:50.511
Don't get scammed again.

40:53.820 --> 40:55.100
It's all in the card, every cent.

40:55.300 --> 40:56.044
Let me see.

40:58.577 --> 40:59.577
What are you doing?

40:59.644 --> 41:00.511
Paying for the room.

41:00.644 --> 41:01.780
Why should I pay?

41:01.780 --> 41:03.355
If you stay in a hotel without paying,

41:03.400 --> 41:04.444
they'll call the police.

41:04.580 --> 41:05.100
You...

41:05.260 --> 41:07.060
Didn't you say you had
300,000 in your card?

41:08.820 --> 41:10.340
Mr. He, the deposit is two thousand.

41:38.060 --> 41:38.940
(Incorrect password limit exceeded)

41:51.860 --> 41:52.820
Think carefully.

41:52.888 --> 41:55.155
One more wrong attempt,
and your card will be locked.

42:11.300 --> 42:12.140
Later, have the staff

42:12.220 --> 42:14.000
bring up the two cases
of beer I ordered.

42:17.020 --> 42:17.660
Hey,

42:17.940 --> 42:18.977
where's Lin Zhanqiao?

42:24.180 --> 42:24.700
We broke up.

42:26.580 --> 42:27.466
I'm warning you,

42:27.844 --> 42:29.155
don't go looking for her.

42:29.940 --> 42:32.060
How could you have broken up?

42:32.577 --> 42:34.220
If she doesn't
follow you around all day,

42:34.220 --> 42:36.288
talking non-stop, she can't
even get through a day.

42:36.660 --> 42:37.260
Don't worry.

42:37.644 --> 42:39.733
Whether you broke up or not,
I'll go find her.

42:39.800 --> 42:40.533
Because only she

42:40.620 --> 42:42.100
is willing to treat me to good drinks.

42:42.580 --> 42:44.900
So don't try to scare me
with that breakup talk.

42:45.511 --> 42:46.422
We really broke up.

42:48.540 --> 42:49.300
I'll say it again.

42:49.644 --> 42:50.911
Don't go looking for her.

42:51.020 --> 42:52.311
Don't make a fool of yourself.

43:05.921 --> 43:07.041
(I've been thinking.)

43:08.321 --> 43:11.601
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:12.361 --> 43:19.691
(is probably different.)

43:20.691 --> 43:22.441
♪If the sky♪

43:22.951 --> 43:24.351
♪And the sea♪

43:24.891 --> 43:26.601
♪Turned upside down♪

43:28.161 --> 43:30.091
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:30.491 --> 43:33.881
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:35.651 --> 43:37.621
♪If back then♪

43:37.981 --> 43:42.391
♪We had never let go♪

43:42.991 --> 43:49.271
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

43:50.391 --> 43:52.541
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

43:52.541 --> 43:54.411
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

43:54.591 --> 43:57.031
♪And found our way back whole♪

43:57.871 --> 44:00.041
♪So let this surging love♪

44:00.041 --> 44:04.471
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:05.371 --> 44:07.551
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:07.551 --> 44:08.641
♪That's alright♪

44:09.181 --> 44:09.931
♪If we're buried♪

44:09.931 --> 44:12.631
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:12.891 --> 44:15.071
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:15.251 --> 44:19.671
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:35.431 --> 44:37.721
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

44:37.721 --> 44:39.481
♪Running in opposite ways♪

44:39.601 --> 44:42.071
♪Searching all along the way♪

44:42.871 --> 44:45.031
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

44:45.221 --> 44:50.131
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

44:50.131 --> 44:53.651
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

44:53.891 --> 44:54.861
♪Only after loss♪

44:54.861 --> 44:57.491
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

44:57.901 --> 45:00.261
♪In another time and space♪

45:00.261 --> 45:01.821
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:01.821 --> 45:04.651
♪Till we grow old♪

45:05.611 --> 45:07.901
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:07.901 --> 45:10.571
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:13.091 --> 45:15.501
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:15.501 --> 45:20.711
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
